9" 17592186045417] [17592186096411 1074 "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{ \n                          f'(x)             &= \\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(4e^x+3x^{4} - x^2 \\right)\\\n                                             &= \\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(4e^x\\right)+\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(3x^{4}\\right) -\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(x^{2}\\right) \\\n\t\t\t\t\t     &= 4\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(e^x\\right)+3\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(x^{4}\\right) - 2x \\\t\t\t\n                                             &=  4 e^x+  3 \\cdot 4x^{3} - 2x \\\n                                             &=  4 e^x+  12x^{3} - 2x.\n}\n$$" 17592186045417] [17592186096412 1069 "e-3626" 17592186045417] [17592186096412 1071 "Given that $f(x)=3 \\cdot 2^x$, find $f'(x).$" 17592186045417] [17592186096412 1072 #uuid "16b1a91c-ae83-5e6b-a11d-bb9d78e4d218" 17592186045417] [17592186096412 1074 "Applying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\tf'(x)      &= \\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(3 \\cdot 2^x\\right) \\\n                            &= 3 \\cdot \\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}\\left(2^x\\right) \\\n                            &=  3 \\cdot 2^{x}\\ln(2) \\\n                            &=  3 \\ln(2) \\cdot 2^{x}.\n\t}\n$$" 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1037 17592186048932 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186097160 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186097316 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186237849 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186237850 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186314904 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186314906 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186338886 17592186045417] [17592186096610 1038 17592186480008 17592186045443] [17592186096610 1038 17592186480009 17592186045443] [17592186096610 1038 17592186480011 17592186045443] [17592186096610 1038 17592186480014 17592186045443] [1759218